6. **allowUnknownProtocols defaults to TRUE** (HTMLElementSanitizerConfiguration.java:131) - default allows all non-script/data schemes including blob:
7. **SanitizerFilter only sanitizes when RESTRICTED=true** (SanitizerFilter.java:79) - opt-in sanitization creates risk when callers forget to set parameter
8. **getAllowedUriRegexp completely replaces IS_ALLOWED_URI** (SecureHTMLElementSanitizer.java:157) - admin-configurable regex can bypass IS_SCRIPT_OR_DATA check path
